></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">templates</span></code></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Also confirm </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">app.py</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">, </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">requirements.txt</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">, </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.gitignore</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">, and </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">README.md</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> are present.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Tell me if all are visible.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="c