ion="col" data-dil-message-id="78d3bbcd-ca38-4e1f-bdb4-fb5e50b128ff"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">This is a great homepage screenshot! 🌱 It clearly communicates Agro AI's purpose, and the green agricultural theme looks professional.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Let's use this as your first project screenshot.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Next step: Save it inside your project.</span></span></p><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Right-click the screenshot you uploaded and save it as </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">home-page.png</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Place it inside your project's </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">static</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> folder.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Your structure should look like:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="code_block"><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none gap-2 ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-aa639d68eb411420.svg#codex-icon-code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 truncate flex-1">Plain text</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disab